abstract: >-
  AgriPredict AI is an aivancity AI Clinic 2026 research prototype for
  parcel-level wheat harvest-date forecasting in Centre-Val de Loire using
  soil, Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2 and meteorological data. It compares May 31 and
  June 15 information cutoffs under temporal and parcel-grouped validation.
